CRR-002 disposable actual-store regression probe
Reviewed HEAD: 18d4021f1fb710c92d55eec591d2c0b8b291c49d
The temporary test imported current ApplicationExecutionEventJournalStore and ApplicationPlatformStateStore.
It independently exercised (1) an existing empty platform SQLite DB and (2) a journal DB created by appendEventAwaitable.
Both expected the current implementation to reject with SQLite read-only write failure; both expectations passed.
The temporary probe file was removed after execution and is not durable product coverage.


